        <StudyOverview>
            <Title>Influenza burden assessment in adults aged of 65 years and more visiting a general practitioner for acute respiratory illness in France</Title>
            <Acronym>EFG Senior</Acronym>
            <StudyStatus>
                <value>Unknown</value>
            </StudyStatus>
            <Purpose>Describe and compare the burden of acute respiratory infections (IRA) linked to influenza virus, in terms of morbidity and medical consumption, according to the vaccinal status, in those 65 years and older spontaneously consulting in general practice</Purpose>
